{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922043309_137d4a16","chunk_index":14,"job_id":"mwjob_cffd00bfa3697e3b95523084","precondition_digest":"f483172f30b055a8b1e1a0031ff9bcf82f903ed2e0e2f5846600e2e4c3920808","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v8","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_39e4b116abc0cd5e","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_25e1c06d0b06aa86","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_88e2c46a69d01a79","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_3a0ca66f9b437b15"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922043309_137d4a16","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:a8e3d8c06822916390b63dba","quote":"章节编号=8.4\n章节标题=不良事件的采集与记录","quote_sha256":"955854a4c12cd760ec0fe42057f1163c0ff4ed223dc318372ba0f7c12a912eed","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:a8e3d8c06822916390b63dba","span_id":"ev_sec84_identity"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"安全性终点：治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","quote_sha256":"99133b9298d6b094501b14430ac89a3b690a9aa9acb4bb1df325ea3196a44236","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_proj_safety_endpoints"},{"locator":"section:不良事件的采集与记录|block:678|chunk:1","quote":"研究者负责确保所有不良事件记录在参与者病历和eCRF的不良事件页中，并根据本节和第8.6节“不良事件的报告”提供的说明，向申办者报告不良事件。对于eCRF不良事件页中记录的每例次不良事件，研究者将评估其严重性、严重程度和与试验药物CMS-D017的相关性。","quote_sha256":"4ecf3eb61d3e778bb07a7f178eae0696c795336bd5e5ebcebc5fba44ae18fa34","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:da3d46a6971245","span_id":"ev_corpus_ae_record_assess"},{"locator":"section:不良事件的随访|block:831|chunk:1","quote":"研究期间，应在参与者病历和eCRF不良事件上记录不良事件的结局（包括日期），便于源数据查验。","quote_sha256":"fb19c2ad5f927a50f004bee304bfbe959f7a785d574e16c34667a405918f27c3","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","span_id":"ev_corpus_ae_outcome_verify"}],"evidence_span_ids":["ev_sec84_identity","ev_proj_safety_endpoints","ev_corpus_ae_record_assess","ev_corpus_ae_outcome_verify"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":1},"heading":"不良事件的采集与记录","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究将治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件的发生率，以及实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化，作为本方案的安全性终点。不良事件相关信息的采集与记录应满足完整、准确的要求，以支持对事件严重性、严重程度及与试验药物相关性的评价。对于每例次不良事件，应记录其结局（包括日期）及相关信息，并保持记录与源数据一致，以便进行源数据查验和后续安全性分析。","rationale":"证据支撑：已确认研究事实中的安全性终点包括治疗期间出现的不良事件、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件，实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图的临床意义变化亦属安全性评价内容；不良事件的结局及日期应予记录并便于源数据查验。供医学作者核对：不良事件的完整定义与豁免情形、采集起止时间点、记录字段清单，以及源文件与病例报告表的填写要求。","review_advisories":["本节引用公司语料形成共性表述；定稿时请用本项目权威文件复核适用性。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_39e4b116abc0cd5e","section_number":"8.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:a8e3d8c06822916390b63dba","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:455161bcd6a708","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:272acba4ac29f2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:da3d46a6971245","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922043309_137d4a16","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:a8e3d8c06822916390b63dba","quote":"章节编号=8.5\n章节标题=不良事件的评估","quote_sha256":"0990d4b4a0e9cf80c6717ddb8bfe017b42e8558312feffda3ea694fcfdd81b42","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:a8e3d8c06822916390b63dba","span_id":"ev_sec85_identity"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"安全性终点：治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","quote_sha256":"99133b9298d6b094501b14430ac89a3b690a9aa9acb4bb1df325ea3196a44236","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_proj_safety_endpoints"},{"locator":"section:不良事件的采集与记录|block:678|chunk:1","quote":"研究者负责确保所有不良事件记录在参与者病历和eCRF的不良事件页中，并根据本节和第8.6节“不良事件的报告”提供的说明，向申办者报告不良事件。对于eCRF不良事件页中记录的每例次不良事件，研究者将评估其严重性、严重程度和与试验药物CMS-D017的相关性。","quote_sha256":"4ecf3eb61d3e778bb07a7f178eae0696c795336bd5e5ebcebc5fba44ae18fa34","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:da3d46a6971245","span_id":"ev_corpus_ae_record_assess"}],"evidence_span_ids":["ev_sec85_identity","ev_proj_safety_endpoints","ev_corpus_ae_record_assess"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":1,"project_fact_spans":1},"heading":"不良事件的评估","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"对研究期间采集到的每一例次不良事件，均应评估其严重程度、严重性及与试验药物的相关性。评价结论及所依据的信息应完整记录，确保评价过程清晰、可追溯，并能够支持后续的安全性汇总分析。上述评价结果为治疗期间出现的不良事件、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件等安全性终点的分析提供基础。","rationale":"证据支撑：已确认研究事实中的安全性终点设置，以及对每例次不良事件评估严重程度、严重性和与试验药物相关性的章节结构。供医学作者核对：严重程度分级标准、相关性判定分类与判定规则、评价人员与复核流程，以及是否采用统一的分级工具。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_25e1c06d0b06aa86","section_number":"8.5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:a8e3d8c06822916390b63dba","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:455161bcd6a708","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:272acba4ac29f2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:da3d46a6971245","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922043309_137d4a16","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:a8e3d8c06822916390b63dba","quote":"章节编号=8.6\n章节标题=不良事件的报告","quote_sha256":"79f63c05f0e13b7330f633cb07d18dbf0b6be8226c98822be85f012f43394bcc","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:a8e3d8c06822916390b63dba","span_id":"ev_sec86_identity"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"安全性终点：治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","quote_sha256":"99133b9298d6b094501b14430ac89a3b690a9aa9acb4bb1df325ea3196a44236","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_proj_safety_endpoints"},{"locator":"section:不良事件的采集与记录|block:678|chunk:1","quote":"研究者负责确保所有不良事件记录在参与者病历和eCRF的不良事件页中，并根据本节和第8.6节“不良事件的报告”提供的说明，向申办者报告不良事件。对于eCRF不良事件页中记录的每例次不良事件，研究者将评估其严重性、严重程度和与试验药物CMS-D017的相关性。","quote_sha256":"4ecf3eb61d3e778bb07a7f178eae0696c795336bd5e5ebcebc5fba44ae18fa34","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:da3d46a6971245","span_id":"ev_corpus_ae_record_assess"}],"evidence_span_ids":["ev_sec86_identity","ev_proj_safety_endpoints","ev_corpus_ae_record_assess"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":1,"project_fact_spans":1},"heading":"不良事件的报告","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"研究期间发生的不良事件、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件，均应按照适用的法律法规和相关要求进行报告。报告信息应真实、完整、准确，并与源数据及相关记录保持一致；对于严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件，应在报告中体现其严重性及与试验药物相关性评价的结果。规范的报告流程有助于保证安全性信息及时传递，并支持研究整体的安全性评价。","rationale":"证据支撑：严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件属于已确认研究事实中的安全性终点；报告信息应与源数据及相关记录保持一致。供医学作者核对：报告对象、报告时限、报告路径、揭盲要求以及与监管部门的沟通要求。","review_advisories":["本节引用公司语料形成共性表述；定稿时请用本项目权威文件复核适用性。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_88e2c46a69d01a79","section_number":"8.6","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:a8e3d8c06822916390b63dba","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:455161bcd6a708","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:272acba4ac29f2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:da3d46a6971245","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922043309_137d4a16","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:a8e3d8c06822916390b63dba","quote":"章节编号=8.7\n章节标题=不良事件的随访","quote_sha256":"932151f86408fb011a2b1264f8dd98018f8767f4d989ee10409c13a7db1f71a9","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:a8e3d8c06822916390b63dba","span_id":"ev_sec87_identity"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"安全性终点：治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","quote_sha256":"99133b9298d6b094501b14430ac89a3b690a9aa9acb4bb1df325ea3196a44236","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_proj_safety_endpoints"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_proj_periods"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"8c7a570d51b842be51c8689066b3d6fe50030b8229d96708644c920d085e82c5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_proj_visits"},{"locator":"section:不良事件的随访|block:831|chunk:1","quote":"研究期间，应在参与者病历和eCRF不良事件上记录不良事件的结局（包括日期），便于源数据查验。","quote_sha256":"fb19c2ad5f927a50f004bee304bfbe959f7a785d574e16c34667a405918f27c3","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","span_id":"ev_corpus_ae_outcome_verify"}],"evidence_span_ids":["ev_sec87_identity","ev_proj_safety_endpoints","ev_proj_periods","ev_proj_visits","ev_corpus_ae_outcome_verify"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":1,"project_fact_spans":3},"heading":"不良事件的随访","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究在双盲治疗期结束后设有4周安全性随访期，并在第20周进行安全性随访访视。研究期间发生的不良事件应记录其结局及相关日期，以便进行源数据查验。对于安全性随访期内报告的不良事件，应完整记录其结局信息，保证不良事件资料的完整性和可追溯性，并为治疗期间出现的不良事件、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件的安全性评价提供支持。","rationale":"证据支撑：已确认研究事实中，双盲治疗期结束后的安全性随访期为4周，第20周进行安全性随访访视；不良事件的结局及日期应予记录以便源数据查验。供医学作者核对：未恢复事件的随访终止标准、随访方式及与研究结束时点的衔接。","review_advisories":["本节引用公司语料形成共性表述；定稿时请用本项目权威文件复核适用性。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_3a0ca66f9b437b15","section_number":"8.7","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:a8e3d8c06822916390b63dba","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:455161bcd6a708","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:272acba4ac29f2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:da3d46a6971245","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:a8e3d8c06822916390b63dba","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:a8e3d8c06822916390b63dba","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"7d0edae3d6fee520706d4094ceab332798a486c5b3373a5db2e0b385a48df122"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","text_sha256":"787313a6f081b1c9afdf03800feb1c50c317aa4aa4f0c3884e924b0594e666da"},{"locator":"section:治疗期出现的不良事件（TEAE）|block:671|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:455161bcd6a708","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"363e16249ca6a2c3ff0ae1da9497be4bfa903b7a8fff2c7e770b6400d6b9c762"},{"locator":"section:不良事件的收集与记录|block:711|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:272acba4ac29f2","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"7f2b0dd5ecd2034e000dfb11c32806bfc841715e665247b4b5fa6f1b33d20776"},{"locator":"section:8.4.9.2 不良事件|block:1136|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"a4dbbca5ee93dd8afdc70483dd7648214180490ccefcd4eceab6680c02415d81"},{"locator":"section:不良事件的采集与记录|block:678|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:da3d46a6971245","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"4ecf3eb61d3e778bb07a7f178eae0696c795336bd5e5ebcebc5fba44ae18fa34"},{"locator":"section:不良事件的随访|block:831|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"e9a73951b4b81029575c055f51e285b89ca3c683bf8d59bb10d324446e599f88"}]}